# AIQA

AIQA helps teams trace and evaluate AI applications using OpenTelemetry.

## For coding agents

- Read the [integration docs](https://aiqa.winterwell.com/docs.html) before changing an AIQA integration.
- Send traces to the configured AIQA OTLP endpoint using the project's API key. Keep credentials out of source control.
- To record thumbs-up/down feedback, export a span in the response's trace with `gen_ai.operation.name=feedback`, `feedback.value=positive|negative`, and optional `feedback.comment`.
- Keep the feedback span's trace ID the same as the AI response's trace ID.
